# Test screenshots change on every run (fonts, animation frames, fights), so they aren't tracked. CI uploads all of them
# as the ui-screenshots artifact on every run. Tracked: the review sheets, regenerated and committed when the look
# changes on purpose (showcase/screenshot.png, the README's, is outside this folder and tracked too).
tests/screenshots/*
!tests/screenshots/layout-review-cards.png
!tests/screenshots/fightview-cards.png
!tests/screenshots/fightview-turn.png
